  "conventions": {
    "amounts": "decimal strings of raw integer units",
    "program": "M3 Execution IR, SWAP opcode only. A source JIT_SWAP hop is replaced by its baseline pool and labelled policy_off, which is an adaptation (contract §6). Slot 0 is the order input",
