      "route_plan_note": "The 180 is taken from members greedily in ascending slot order (101 from s1, 79 from s2), and the remainder uses ALL_REMAINING on every member that still holds a balance (s2: 199 - 79 = 120). Any split of the 180 between members feeds BC1 the same 180; the greedy rule only makes recovery deterministic (contract §5.3)",
